---
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/bethandtom.jpg';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Us"
	description="We are Beth and Tom from Sheffield, UK"
	pubDate={new Date('August 08 2026')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<p>
		We are Beth and Tom from Sheffield, UK, and we are preparing to ride the Great Divide
		Mountain Bike Route from Canada to Mexico.
	</p>

	<p>
		This site will collect the route map, short updates from the road, photos from each stage,
		and links to the charities we are supporting. The practical rhythm should be simple: ride,
		send a Garmin inReach point when we can, post a short note when we have signal, then keep
		moving south.
	</p>

	<p>
		Charity details and donation links can be added here once they are confirmed.
	</p>
</Layout>
